{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"story_totter_set_2_story_1","storyGroup":"story_totter_set_2","storySort":0,"storyDependence":null,"storyCanShow":0,"storyCode":null,"storyName":"归乡","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"铅踝回到自己的家乡，想要找寻一处安静的居所休憩，度过最后的时光，但阴差阳错下，他的平静日子一去不返。","storyCanEnter":0,"storyTxt":"obt/memory/story_totter_2_1","avgTag":"幕间","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":0,"requiredStages":null,"characters":["智者侍从","哥伦比亚旅人","“智者”","维多利亚旅人","玻利瓦尔旅人","莱塔尼亚旅人","各国旅人","托特尔","罗德岛外勤干员","罗德岛信使","？？？"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"playsound","key":"$keyboard","id":5},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":6},{"type":"text","text":"这一切都始自公司的厕所，那天我在马桶上嚎啕大哭，为自己一团乱麻的人生感到绝望。","id":7},{"type":"text","text":"隔间外，几位从萨尔贡度假回来的同事聊起了自己的假日时光，从他们口中我听到了一个名字，与一段使我平静下来的妙论。","id":8},{"type":"text","text":"于是，我背起行囊，历尽艰辛，从哥伦比亚的钢铁丛林到萨尔贡的茂密雨林，最终抵达此地，见到了那位智者。","id":9},{"type":"dialog","id":10},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ec/Avg_bg_bg_jungle_1.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":11},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":12},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_calm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":13,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"4","block":"true","id":14},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":15},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_070","focus":"m","id":16},{"type":"dialogue","name":"智者侍从","text":"欢迎来到静修之地，怎么样，你今天见到智者了吗？","id":17,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_070.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":18},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哥伦比亚旅人","text":"非常荣幸，虽然见到智者时已经很晚了，但他还是耐心倾听了我的问题，并为我解答。","id":19,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_070","focus":"m","id":20},{"type":"dialogue","name":"智者侍从","text":"他怎么说？","id":21,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_070.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哥伦比亚旅人","text":"他用行动代替了自己的语言，一言不发地卷着自己手上的绳索。","id":23,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_070","focus":"m","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"智者侍从","text":"......绳索？","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_070.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哥伦比亚旅人","text":"对，智者是想告诉我，烦恼如乱麻，但只要耐心以对，就能将其编织为一根根绳索。","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哥伦比亚旅人","text":"然后它们自会柔顺地盘在手心，不再让人头痛。","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_070","focus":"m","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"智者侍从","text":"咳......有道理，很有道理，不愧是智者。","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_070.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_070","focus":"m","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"智者侍从","text":"当然，你的悟性也很高，能够迅速体悟智者言行举止间所蕴含的真理。","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_070.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哥伦比亚旅人","text":"是啊，分别时，智者还满含深意地看了我一眼，我想，这正是他对我的赞许吧。","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_070","focus":"m","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"智者侍从","text":"对，你说得对......","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_070.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哥伦比亚旅人","text":"其实，一开始，我还以为这次心灵之旅只是传得夸张。","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_070","focus":"m","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"智者侍从","text":"不，我们跟从智者指引，从不会欺骗他人。","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_070.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哥伦比亚旅人","text":"我想，我今天会带着满足睡去。","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_070","focus":"m","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"智者侍从","text":"那就睡个好觉吧，先生。明天的讲会将在早上八点准时开始，到时将由我带领大家前往会场。","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_070.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":46},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":47},{"type":"charslot","id":48},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5d/Avg_bg_bg_falls_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":49},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":50},{"type":"charslot","id":51},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#3$1","duration":"2","id":52},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“智者”","text":"......人们独自行过自己的一生......","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#3$1","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“智者”","text":"犹如泛孤舟于湖面......","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":57},{"type":"charslot","id":58},{"type":"text","text":"瀑布下，智者盘坐在湖中央的巨石上，为湖边众人讲述着他从潺潺流水中获得的哲思，语调和缓。","id":59},{"type":"text","text":"众人凝神，感受着温和的话语如同流水般浸润内心。","id":60},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","focus":"m","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚旅人","text":"嘿，朋友，你来多久了？","id":62,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哥伦比亚旅人","text":"昨天才来，你呢？来多久了？","id":64,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","focus":"m","id":65},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚旅人","text":"已经快一个月了，想不到吧，一个月前我还沉浸在上一段感情的阴影中，颓废异常。","id":66,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哥伦比亚旅人","text":"可你现在看着容光焕发......哦，肯定是智者。","id":68,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","focus":"m","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚旅人","text":"是，是他带领我走出了悲痛。","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":71},{"type":"charslot","id":72},{"type":"text","text":"听到人群中的谈论，智者停顿片刻，看向远方，向众人展露笑容。","id":73},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哥伦比亚旅人","text":"嘘，智者往我这边看了！我......","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","focus":"m","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚旅人","text":"哦......智者的眼睛是多么温柔，好像能治愈我内心的苦闷。","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","focus":"m","id":78},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚旅人","text":"我感觉......在他那迷离的、充满仁爱与理解的目光中，我将与周遭万物达成和解。","id":79,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#3$1","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“智者”","text":"只要意识到发生在我们身上的种种就像我们身边的流水......","id":81,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#3$1","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“智者”","text":"......终究只是流淌而过，不会停留。","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_201","focus":"m","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玻利瓦尔旅人","text":"啊！是那个动作，智者的招牌动作，他向众人伸出了手！","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_npc_201.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","focus":"m","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚旅人","text":"哦！他要说出那句话了！","id":87,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哥伦比亚旅人","text":"是什么？！智者要说什么？！","id":89,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_065","focus":"m","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱塔尼亚旅人","text":"别急！他马上就会讲了！","id":91,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_npc_065.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#3$1","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“智者”","text":"放下对生活的期待......","id":93,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":94},{"type":"charslot","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"各国旅人","text":"任流水带我去远方！","id":96},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哥伦比亚旅人","text":"......","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哥伦比亚旅人","text":"哇哦。","id":100,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":101},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":102},{"type":"charslot","id":103},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_bg_bg_falls_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":104},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":105},{"type":"charslot","id":106},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_070","focus":"m","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"智者侍从","text":"托特尔，你中间停了一会儿，为什么？","id":108,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_070.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#1$1","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“智者”","text":"我听到人群中有声音，所以停下来看看。","id":110,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_070","focus":"m","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"智者侍从","text":"哦，是哪个家伙不专心？","id":112,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_070.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#1$1","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“智者”","text":"不知道，没戴眼镜看不清。","id":114,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#1$1","id":115},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“智者”","text":"嘶......下次讲会可以换个地方吗？水边蚊子太多了。","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_070","focus":"m","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"智者侍从","text":"咳咳，也没下次了，按照我们的剧本，你马上就要退居幕后了。","id":118,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_070.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#1$1","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“智者”","text":"......可算要结束了。","id":120,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_070","focus":"m","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"智者侍从","text":"多亏你，咱们这几个月靠游客挣了不少钱。","id":122,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_070.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_070","focus":"m","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"智者侍从","text":"唉，要不是这几年过得实在太潦倒，我们也不至于为难你一个病患。","id":124,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_070.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#1$1","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“智者”","text":"没关系，离开家乡这么久，两手空空地回来，实话说有些对不住大家......能帮着大家找到一个发财的路子也挺好。","id":126,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#1$1","id":127},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“智者”","text":"毕竟父亲离开后，是乡亲们为我凑齐路费，如今也该我报答大家。","id":128,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_070","focus":"m","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"智者侍从","text":"说来也是不好意思，打扰了你最后的平静生活。","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_070.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#1$1","id":131},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“智者”","text":"我也没有预料到顺手救下那支旅游团会带来这么多麻烦。谁知道他们回去后乱讲了什么，突然某天就有一堆人找上门来......","id":132,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_070","focus":"m","id":133},{"type":"dialogue","name":"智者侍从","text":"咳咳，乍一听还以为是村子里出了个大人物。","id":134,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_070.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_070","focus":"m","id":135},{"type":"dialogue","name":"智者侍从","text":"顺着他们说了一通后，才明白他们找的人是你，本来还打算继续编些瞎话从他们手里赚点情报费的。","id":136,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_070.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#1$1","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“智者”","text":"所以你这骗钱的计划那时就有雏形了吗？","id":138,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_070","focus":"m","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"智者侍从","text":"我只是讲了他们想听的话而已，顺着别人心意讲话可是要技巧的，收点钱怎么了？","id":140,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_070.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#11$1","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“智者”","text":"（眯眼）","id":142,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_070","focus":"m","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"智者侍从","text":"咳咳，比起移动城市的心理咨询师，确实也没收多少。","id":144,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_070.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_070","focus":"m","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"智者侍从","text":"给你的报酬为什么退回来了，那可是好大一笔钱，你就没有什么想要的东西了吗？","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_070.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#1$1","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“智者”","text":"没......我只想平静地度过接下来的日子。","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_070","focus":"m","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"智者侍从","text":"只要你像河水般接纳投入其中的所有事物，自会流淌至远方。","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_070.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#5$1","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“智者”","text":"......这不是明天剧本里的词吗？","id":152,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/43/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_070","focus":"m","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"智者侍从","text":"很好，看来你已经通读过了。","id":154,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_070.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":155},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":156},{"type":"charslot","id":157},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":158},{"type":"playsound","key":"$keyboard","id":159},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":160},{"type":"text","text":"我与智者同行的时间是如此短暂。","id":161},{"type":"text","text":"在雨林里停留半月后，他突然向所有人宣布，要离开大家，开始一段新的旅程，去往一个全新的地方。","id":162},{"type":"text","text":"他宣布了自己的死讯。","id":163},{"type":"dialog","id":164},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":165},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5d/Avg_bg_bg_falls_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":166},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":167},{"type":"charslot","id":168},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside","volume":"0.4","channel":"bse","id":169},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":170},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","focus":"m","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚旅人","text":"先生，这是有什么急事吗？","id":172,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_070","focus":"m","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"智者侍从","text":"我也并不知情，智者只是让我通知大家聚集在这里。","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_070.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","focus":"m","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚旅人","text":"哎呀，您不早些告诉我，我还穿着自己的睡衣呢......这样衣衫不整去见智者多冒犯。","id":176,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_070","focus":"m","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"智者侍从","text":"无妨无妨，智者本人不拘小节，不会在意这些的。","id":178,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_070.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","focus":"m","id":179},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚旅人","text":"哦，看......","id":180,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":181},{"type":"charslot","id":182},{"type":"text","text":"葱郁的雨林中，几只角兽缓缓走出，在瀑布边驻足。片刻后，又有更多动物走出雨林，聚在岸边。","id":183},{"type":"text","text":"一条鳞跃出水面，激起的水纹却久久不散。","id":184},{"type":"text","text":"随即，众人发现，河水早已静止，甚至从悬崖倾泻而下的水帘也不再流动。","id":185},{"type":"text","text":"而智者从水帘后缓缓走出，身着素衣。","id":186},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#1$1","id":187},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“智者”","text":"诸位，久等了。","id":188,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":189},{"type":"charslot","id":190},{"type":"text","text":"话音刚落，河水再次流动。","id":191},{"type":"dialog","id":192},{"type":"charslot","id":193},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哥伦比亚旅人","text":"智者！！","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","focus":"m","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚旅人","text":"哎哎，你别一个劲儿地往前挤啊！！","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":198},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哥伦比亚旅人","text":"这次我一定要离近点让智者看到我支持他的模样！","id":199,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","focus":"m","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚旅人","text":"智者，天才刚亮，您要和我们讲什么？","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#1$1","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“智者”","text":"昨天晚上，我在丛林夜游的时候，看到星光从树叶的间隙洒下，落在湖面上，我......","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#1$1","id":204},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“智者”","text":"唉......诸位......","id":205,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#1$1","id":206},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“智者”","text":"在那里我看到了自己生命的尽头......呼唤你们来到这里，只是想与大家作别。","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","focus":"m","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚旅人","text":"您是在开玩笑吗，智者？","id":209,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_070","focus":"m","id":210},{"type":"dialogue","name":"智者侍从","text":"妄议，智者从来不开玩笑。","id":211,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_070.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_201","focus":"m","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玻利瓦尔旅人","text":"智者，难道您能预知自己的未来吗？","id":213,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_npc_201.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#1$1","id":214},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“智者”","text":"未来与过去不过是一条河流的两段，只要身处河水中，自然就能从水面荡起的波纹中解读出从远方传来的信息。","id":215,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#1$1","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“智者”","text":"但窥见自己的命运是要付出代价的，我感觉到自己正在被此地排斥，在这世间的旅途也即将走到尽头。","id":217,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","focus":"m","id":218},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚旅人","text":"智者......面对死亡，您为何这样无动于衷？","id":219,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#1$1","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“智者”","text":"在离开前，我早已接受自己的结局，寻觅到了内心的平静。","id":221,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#1$1","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“智者”","text":"诸位也不要为我伤心，死亡对我来说，不过是另一段旅程，另一段修行。","id":223,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":224},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哥伦比亚旅人","text":"哦，您的面庞，看起来是多么宁静......","id":225,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#1$1","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“智者”","text":"我早已对历经的一切释怀，正如河水接纳投入其中的所有事物，然后兀自流淌至远方。","id":227,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_201","focus":"m","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玻利瓦尔旅人","text":"智者，在您离开前，可否告诉我您是如何解读这一切的？！","id":229,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_npc_201.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#1$1","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“智者”","text":"天机不可泄露。","id":231,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#1$1","id":232},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“智者”","text":"别了，诸位......","id":233,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":234},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":235},{"type":"charslot","id":236},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_bg_bg_aerialview.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":237},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":238},{"type":"charslot","id":239},{"type":"text","text":"一只羽兽落在智者的肩头，他闭上双眼，垂下头，好似进入深眠。","id":240},{"type":"text","text":"在他脚下，河水急速流动，形成漩涡。","id":241},{"type":"text","text":"水花高高溅起，再一眨眼，智者便沉入漩涡中心了。","id":242},{"type":"text","text":"只留下一个小小漩涡，在湖面静静旋转。","id":243},{"type":"dialog","id":244},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":245},{"type":"charslot","id":246},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":247},{"type":"playsound","key":"$keyboard","id":248},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":249},{"type":"text","text":"在哥伦比亚，我是个失败的家伙，不仅破产，家庭也濒临破碎，但此次旅行令我找回了重新面对生活的勇气。","id":250},{"type":"text","text":"智者面对死亡时的豁达与超脱令我深信，总会有一条河流带走我曾历经的伤痛。","id":251},{"type":"dialog","id":252},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":253},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ec/Avg_bg_bg_jungle_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":254},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":255},{"type":"charslot","id":256},{"type":"playsound","key":"$leaveshake","volume":"0.6","id":257},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":258},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#5$1","duration":"1","id":259},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":260},{"type":"dialogue","name":"托特尔","text":"奇怪......这好像不是约定好的地方。","id":261,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/43/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#4$1","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"托特尔","text":"那家伙怎么挖的水道？真是的，竟然拐到这里来了。","id":263,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/61/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":264},{"type":"charslot","id":265},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":266},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","duration":"1","id":267},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":268},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哥伦比亚旅人","text":"智者？","id":269,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#1$1","id":270},{"type":"dialogue","name":"托特尔","text":"......","id":271,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#3$1","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"托特尔","text":"河水流淌，正如时光在......","id":273,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":274},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哥伦比亚旅人","text":"我都懂的，您不必说了。","id":275,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#1$1","id":276},{"type":"dialogue","name":"托特尔","text":"你会说出去吗？","id":277,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#1$1","id":278},{"type":"dialogue","name":"托特尔","text":"你知道吗？我的真实身份其实是雇佣兵。","id":279,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":280},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哥伦比亚旅人","text":"呃......放心好了，要说的话我早就说了。","id":281,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":282},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哥伦比亚旅人","text":"从第一天来到这里后，我就察觉到不对了，那些浅显的大道理其实很难打动谁。","id":283,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#1$1","id":284},{"type":"dialogue","name":"托特尔","text":"但你们看起来并无异议。","id":285,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":286},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哥伦比亚旅人","text":"呃......为什么要有？","id":287,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":288},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哥伦比亚旅人","text":"这里风景不错，吃得很好，扮演智者的人也挺好看——就是老兄你啦。","id":289,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":290},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哥伦比亚旅人","text":"更重要的是，这里花费不高，大家都觉得来度假很实惠。","id":291,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#1$1","id":292},{"type":"dialogue","name":"托特尔","text":"......","id":293,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#1$1","id":294},{"type":"dialogue","name":"托特尔","text":"但我每次表演，你们都很投入，就像是对此深信不疑。","id":295,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":296},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哥伦比亚旅人","text":"还好吧，我一直把它当作景区特色体验来玩的，之前在龙门我也玩过，不过那时扮演的角色是黑帮小弟。","id":297,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#1$1","id":298},{"type":"dialogue","name":"托特尔","text":"我还没有去过龙门。","id":299,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":300},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哥伦比亚旅人","text":"可以去去，挺好玩的。","id":301,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#1$1","id":302},{"type":"dialogue","name":"托特尔","text":"我想应该没有什么机会了。","id":303,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":304},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哥伦比亚旅人","text":"放心好了，都是看破不说破。","id":305,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":306},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哥伦比亚旅人","text":"大家来到这里稍作休息，短暂地逃避现实生活中的烦恼，谁在乎真和假。","id":307,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":308},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哥伦比亚旅人","text":"反正最后我们都要回到那条属于我们自己的河流。","id":309,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#1$1","id":310},{"type":"dialogue","name":"托特尔","text":"就像智者说的。","id":311,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":312},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哥伦比亚旅人","text":"是啊，就像智者说的，我们的烦恼在那里，我们的牵念也在那里。","id":313,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":314},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":315},{"type":"charslot","id":316},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","keep":"true","id":317},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_bg_bg_desert03_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":318},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":319},{"type":"charslot","id":320},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_012","focus":"m","id":321},{"type":"dialogue","name":"罗德岛外勤干员","text":"托特尔，其实......如果你想留在办事处也可以，罗德岛有非常完备的临终关怀计划。","id":322,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_012.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#1$1","id":323},{"type":"dialogue","name":"托特尔","text":"我很感激，但我还是想在家乡度过人生最后的时光。","id":324,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_012","focus":"m","id":325},{"type":"dialogue","name":"罗德岛外勤干员","text":"但你不是说联系不到在家乡的家人吗？","id":326,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_012.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#1$1","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"托特尔","text":"对啊，因为他们都死去了。","id":328,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_012","focus":"m","id":329},{"type":"dialogue","name":"罗德岛外勤干员","text":"那你回去岂不是要孤身一人......","id":330,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_012.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#1$1","id":331},{"type":"dialogue","name":"托特尔","text":"那很好。","id":332,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_012","focus":"m","id":333},{"type":"dialogue","name":"罗德岛外勤干员","text":"......哪里好了。","id":334,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_012.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#1$1","id":335},{"type":"dialogue","name":"托特尔","text":"一个人很安静。","id":336,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#1$1","id":337},{"type":"dialogue","name":"托特尔","text":"身边人的怜悯和悲伤会使我感到烦恼。","id":338,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":339},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":340},{"type":"charslot","id":341},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","keep":"true","id":342},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_bg_bg_village.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":343},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":344},{"type":"charslot","id":345},{"type":"dialog","id":346},{"type":"charslot","id":347},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":348},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#1$1","focus":"m","duration":"1","id":349},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":350},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_070","focus":"m","id":351},{"type":"dialogue","name":"智者侍从","text":"给，干衣服，赶紧换上。","id":352,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_070.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_070","focus":"m","id":353},{"type":"dialogue","name":"智者侍从","text":"你为什么这会儿才来？","id":354,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_070.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#1$1","id":355},{"type":"dialogue","name":"托特尔","text":"......你们找不到其他办法了吗？从瀑布游到这里可不近。","id":356,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_070","focus":"m","id":357},{"type":"dialogue","name":"智者侍从","text":"另一个方案是让你随着纷飞的羽兽一起消失，不过有个缺点，会落一身的羽兽粪便。","id":358,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_070.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#1$1","id":359},{"type":"dialogue","name":"托特尔","text":"那算了，还不如这个。","id":360,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#1$1","id":361},{"type":"dialogue","name":"托特尔","text":"希望我离开后，这场谢幕仍能一直为这里吸引源源不断的旅客。","id":362,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_070","focus":"m","id":363},{"type":"dialogue","name":"智者侍从","text":"其实......雨林这么大，我们肯定能找到一处平静的居所供你休憩，你没必要离开的。","id":364,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_070.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_070","focus":"m","id":365},{"type":"dialogue","name":"智者侍从","text":"我保证，来往的旅客不会打扰到你安宁自在的日子，至于衣食住行的花销，大家来出，你需要什么说一声就是了。","id":366,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_070.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#1$1","id":367},{"type":"dialogue","name":"托特尔","text":"不了，我还是打算离开。","id":368,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_070","focus":"m","id":369},{"type":"dialogue","name":"智者侍从","text":"或许在大家眼里我是个油滑的家伙，但你和我一起长大，我不会骗你。","id":370,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_070.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#1$1","id":371},{"type":"dialogue","name":"托特尔","text":"嗯，知道，我又不傻。","id":372,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_070","focus":"m","id":373},{"type":"dialogue","name":"智者侍从","text":"......那为什么？","id":374,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_070.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#1$1","id":375},{"type":"dialogue","name":"托特尔","text":"智者说的是对的，我应当去寻找一条真正能够接纳我，且使我感到平静的河流。","id":376,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_070","focus":"m","id":377},{"type":"dialogue","name":"智者侍从","text":"智者不就是你自己？","id":378,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_070.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#1$1","id":379},{"type":"dialogue","name":"托特尔","text":"我不是，我只是扮演他的人。","id":380,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_070","focus":"m","id":381},{"type":"dialogue","name":"智者侍从","text":"喂，他说的话可都是我胡写的，托特尔。","id":382,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_070.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#1$1","id":383},{"type":"dialogue","name":"托特尔","text":"无所谓，反正我过日子也是胡来的。","id":384,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":385},{"type":"character","id":386},{"type":"dialog","id":387},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":388},{"type":"charslot","id":389},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":390},{"type":"playsound","key":"$keyboard","id":391},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":392},{"type":"text","text":"智者是否真实存在并不重要，但有一件事是肯定的。","id":393},{"type":"text","text":"人们总是会有烦恼与牵绊，只有接受这一切，才能让人真正平静。","id":394},{"type":"dialog","id":395},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":396},{"type":"dialog","id":397},{"type":"character","id":398},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","volume":"1","id":399},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":400},{"type":"text","text":"我想我已经准备好重新面对未来了。","id":401},{"type":"dialog","id":402},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_bg_bg_corridor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":403},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":404},{"type":"charslot","id":405},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_012","focus":"m","id":406},{"type":"dialogue","name":"罗德岛外勤干员","text":"算算时间......托特尔回家乡已经半年有余了，再过半年，我们一起找个时间去看看他吧。","id":407,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_012.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_088","focus":"m","id":408},{"type":"dialogue","name":"罗德岛信使","text":"......","id":409,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_npc_088.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":410},{"type":"character","id":411},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"嗨......那个......","id":412},{"type":"dialog","id":413},{"type":"character","id":414},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#1$1","focus":"m","duration":"1","id":415},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":416},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_012","focus":"m","id":417},{"type":"dialogue","name":"罗德岛外勤干员","text":"托特尔？！","id":418,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_012.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#1$1","id":419},{"type":"dialogue","name":"托特尔","text":"......出了一些事情，原计划改变了。","id":420,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_012","focus":"m","id":421},{"type":"dialogue","name":"罗德岛外勤干员","text":"啊？","id":422,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_012.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#1$1","id":423},{"type":"dialogue","name":"托特尔","text":"总之我回来了......","id":424,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_012","focus":"m","id":425},{"type":"dialogue","name":"罗德岛外勤干员","text":"那你现在......打算是......不是......我脑袋有点乱。","id":426,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_012.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_088","focus":"m","id":427},{"type":"dialogue","name":"罗德岛信使","text":"哦，既然你回来了，那我就没必要去雨林里找你了，之前有封你的信寄到这里来了。","id":428,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_npc_088.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#5$1","id":429},{"type":"dialogue","name":"托特尔","text":"呃......给我的？","id":430,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/43/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#5$1","id":431},{"type":"dialogue","name":"托特尔","text":"从哪里寄来的？","id":432,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/43/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_088","focus":"m","id":433},{"type":"dialogue","name":"罗德岛信使","text":"雪原。","id":434,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_npc_088.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":435},{"type":"character","id":436},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper1","id":437},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":438},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#1$1","id":439},{"type":"dialogue","name":"托特尔","text":"奇怪......","id":440,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_012","focus":"m","id":441},{"type":"dialogue","name":"罗德岛外勤干员","text":"谁寄来的？","id":442,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_012.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4062_totter_1#1$1","id":443},{"type":"dialogue","name":"托特尔","text":"呃......我想，应该是一些往日的朋友。","id":444,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4062_totter_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":445},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":446},{"type":"dialog","id":447},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":448},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":449},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":450},{"type":"character","id":451},{"type":"image","id":452}],"characters":["智者侍从","哥伦比亚旅人","“智者”","维多利亚旅人","玻利瓦尔旅人","莱塔尼亚旅人","各国旅人","托特尔","罗德岛外勤干员","罗德岛信使","？？？"]}